OL,3,AHenry Nowak's killer has minimum term
OL,4,Aincreased to 25 years by Court of
OL,5,AAppeal
OL,6,
OL,7,FDigwa had sought permission to
OL,8,Fchallenge the length of his sentence at
OL,9,Fthe Court of Appeal
OL,11,FThe Court of Appeal judges ruled the
OL,12,Foriginal sentence was unduly lenient
OL,14,FHis 21-year sentence was quashed and he
OL,15,Fwas given 25 years
OL,17,FJonathan Polnay KC, for the Attorney
OL,18,FGeneral, earlier argued Digwa's 21-year
OL,19,Fminimum term was too lenient, citing
OL,20,Fhis use of a large dagger, abusing the
OL,21,Freligious exemption to carry it, and
OL,22,Fhis conduct as Henry Nowak lay dying
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
